        "Abstract": "The scenarios included in COPA refer to events that took place in the past and are formulated in what can be described as a narrative register: one of the sources from which question topics were drawn was a corpus of personal stories published online. This is grammatically rendered exclusively by means of past simple (preterite) or past continuous (imperfect) verb forms. Temporal anteriority of a hypothesis sentence with respect to the premise is not grammatically marked and can only be deduced based on the prompt. The dataset aims to evaluate cross-lingual understanding."
